{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T07:39:36+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-11-13T07:39:36+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Endesa, S.A.","sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Regulated Electric","country":"Spain","city":"Madrid","website":"https://www.endesa.com","employees":8886,"summary":"Endesa, S.A. engages in the generation, distribution, and sale of electricity in Spain, Portugal, France, Germany, the United Kingdom, Switzerland, Luxembourg, the Netherlands, Singapore, Italy, Morocco, and internationally. It generates electricity from various energy sources, such as hydroelectric, nuclear, thermal, wind, and solar. The company also offers advisory services and technology relating to energy, distributed generation, and energy demand management; deploys infrastructures for charging electric vehicles, vehicle-to-grid, and second-life services for batteries; develops integrated services for local administrations, such as public lighting, smart city development, energy services, and solutions for connectivity; and provides financial solutions for energy producers, as well as offers engineering and construction services for facilities related to the electricity business. As of December 31, 2025, it had an installed capacity of 22, 616 MW; operated 321,843 km of distribution networks and transmission grids; and distributed electricity to 9,590 thousand customers and gas to 1,699 thousand customers. The company was formerly known as Empresa Nacional de Electricidad, S.A. and changed its name to Endesa, S.A. in June 1997. The company was incorporated in 1944 and is headquartered in Madrid, Spain. Endesa, S.A. is a subsidiary of Enel Iberia Srl.","exchange":"MCE","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Endesa, S.A. est active dans la production, la distribution et la vente d’électricité en Espagne, au Portugal, en France, en Allemagne, au Royaume-Uni, en Suisse, au Luxembourg, aux Pays-Bas, à Singapour, en Italie, au Maroc et à l’international. Il produit de l'électricité à partir de diverses sources d'énergie, telles que l'énergie hydroélectrique, nucléaire, thermique, éolienne et solaire. La société offre également des services de conseil et de technologie liés à l'énergie, à la production distribuée et à la gestion de la demande d'énergie; déploie des infrastructures pour la recharge des véhicules électriques, du véhicule au réseau et des services de seconde vie pour les batteries; développe des services intégrés pour les administrations locales, tels que l'éclairage public, le développement des villes intelligentes, les services énergétiques et les solutions de connectivité; fournit des solutions financières aux producteurs d'énergie, ainsi que des services d'ingénierie et de construction pour les installations liées à l'électricité."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":45912956928,"shares_outstanding":1014650934,"trailing_pe":19.25532,"forward_pe":18.681904,"price_to_book":5.8996086,"ev_to_ebitda":10.442,"ev_to_revenue":2.619,"dividend_yield":0.035,"payout_ratio":0.66550004,"beta_yahoo":0.499},"targets":{"current_price":45.25,"mean":36.69087,"median":38.0,"high":44.3,"low":26.2,"n_analysts":23,"reco_mean":3.6087,"reco_key":"underperform"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-10-28"],"eps_avg":0.4135,"eps_low":0.327,"eps_high":0.5,"revenue_avg":5337727200,"ex_dividend":"2026-07-08","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.72472,"institutions_pct":0.120790005,"institutions_float_pct":0.43877998,"institutions_n":410,"institutions":[{"name":"Pacer Advisors, Inc.","pct":0.00059999997,"shares":676629,"value":30617462,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.4347},{"name":"Generali Investments Cee, Investicni Spolecnost, A.s.","pct":0.0,"shares":10524,"value":476211,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":0.0}],"funds":[{"name":"THORNBURG INVESTMENT TRUST-Thornburg Investment Income Builder Fund","pct":0.0105,"shares":10955857